# Playwright Setup

- Put the Playwright TypeScript project under `tests/` (`package.json`, `playwright.config.ts`, `specs/`, `pages/`, `helpers/`, `data/`).
- Define three projects in `playwright.config.ts`: `chromium`, `firefox`, and `webkit`.
- Write HTML reporter output under `reports/<feature>/<browser>/` (e.g. `reports/fr04/chromium/`).
- Every HTML report must visibly show `Run by: 23127044` and an ISO timestamp (title, header, footer, or report metadata).
- Default local SUT URLs: backend `http://localhost:3000`, web `http://localhost:5173`, admin `http://localhost:5174`.
- Run each feature suite once per browser project (≥9 browser runs total for 3 features × 3 browsers).
